            "required_age": 0,
            "is_free": false,
            "controller_support": "full",
            "detailed_description": "Think you're ready to take on the cube? Well grab your Cubot &amp; fire your laser across 50 Arcade levels, and see if you have what it takes to unlock the secrets within. To succeed you will need to evade and annihilate deadly enemies &amp; use your lightning fast reflexes to the fullest! This is a journey where only the best will survive! <br />\r\n<br />\r\nIf this wasn’t enough your skills will be pushed to the limit in the brand new “Challenges” mode. Here you will find 50 bespoke challenges that will really test your new found Cubixx skills to the max. These Challenges will require you to chase the highest scores, beat the fastest times, out smart the bad guys &amp; much more!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOn top of that there are over 150 leaderboards across the 3 brand new Attack modes. Including Score Attack, Line Attack &amp; Time Attack. If all that isn’t enough then grab some friends &amp; play up to 7 local multiplayer co-op, in Arcade &amp; Attack modes or battle up against 7 of your worst enemies in Cubixx Deathmatch!*<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n*Multiplayer via local or 'Remote Play Together'",
            "about_the_game": "Think you're ready to take on the cube? Well grab your Cubot &amp; fire your laser across 50 Arcade levels, and see if you have what it takes to unlock the secrets within. To succeed you will need to evade and annihilate deadly enemies &amp; use your lightning fast reflexes to the fullest! This is a journey where only the best will survive! <br />\r\n<br />\r\nIf this wasn’t enough your skills will be pushed to the limit in the brand new “Challenges” mode. Here you will find 50 bespoke challenges that will really test your new found Cubixx skills to the max. These Challenges will require you to chase the highest scores, beat the fastest times, out smart the bad guys &amp; much more!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOn top of that there are over 150 leaderboards across the 3 brand new Attack modes. Including Score Attack, Line Attack &amp; Time Attack. If all that isn’t enough then grab some friends &amp; play up to 7 local multiplayer co-op, in Arcade &amp; Attack modes or battle up against 7 of your worst enemies in Cubixx Deathmatch!*<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n*Multiplayer via local or 'Remote Play Together'",
            "short_description": "Cubixx HD is a fast paced action puzzle game which sends high scoring, combo chasing gameplay to the third dimension!",
            "supported_languages": "Inglês, Francês, Italiano, Alemão, Espanhol (Espanha)",
            "reviews": {
                "query_summary": {
